OL,3,AUS envoys in Moscow ahead of Ukraine
OL,4,Atalks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fnegotiators are holding talks in Moscow
OL,8,Fwith senior Russian officials, as
OL,9,Fefforts to end the war in Ukraine
OL,10,Fgather pace.
OL,12,FA motorcade with Steve Witkoff and
OL,13,FJared Kushner was seen arriving at the
OL,14,FKremlin, and Russia's state media say
OL,15,Fthe envoys will meet President Vladimir
OL,16,FPutin. On Sunday they will travel to
OL,17,FKyiv for more talks.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
