OL,3,AUS envoys in Moscow ahead of Ukraine
OL,4,Atalks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump told reporters on Friday that
OL,7,FWitkoff and Kushner were "bringing with
OL,8,Fthem a proposal to end the war". So
OL,9,Ffar, efforts from the US and its allies
OL,10,Fto broker a peace deal have failed.
OL,12,FBoth Russia and Ukraine have said they
OL,13,Fwould halt strikes on each others'
OL,14,Fcapital cities for three days while the
OL,15,Fdelegation conducts its visit.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
